{
 "about": "Which text is a callout (family: twin parsers, hunter [notes] 2026-10-31). `callouts` are the expected [type, fold] pairs in order (Obsidian). The reading view (src/notes/calloutContract.test.ts) and the native parser (tests/callout_contract.rs) run these rows. `drift` marks a side that disagrees today.",
